Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Seventh Episode\NThe Battle of Vengeance\NWandering Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Little Coo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter from Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Coo, thanks for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really hard work every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Sapphire and Franz sure love exchanging letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it, I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved Princess Sapphire. To me, you are the moon, the stars, the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those footsteps must be Prince Franz's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets so impatient whenever Princess Sapphire is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Todd, is there a reply yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait a little longer. It should arrive soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we play a game for old time's sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Targeting both ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost. I need another ten years of training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking about your age again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's back! It's back! Prince Franz is eagerly waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like a waste to open it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a master swordsman loses his composure over Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is from the Northern Fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from the Northern Fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What? An unidentified fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To Prince Franz of Goldland...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our X-Union is marching south with a million troops.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Along the way, we subjugated those who surrendered{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and annihilated all who resisted.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goldland, surrender without futile resistance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we receive no answer by the time the moon sets in the west tonight, we will attack.\N- The X-Union{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! The X-Union again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.11,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like war is brewing. And a tough one, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never wear that armor again, but I may have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must they bother attacking our peaceful Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the flag of Charcoalland. What could they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The King of Charcoalland is sending us reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he couldn't stand by during neighboring Goldland's crisis,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and sent 50,000 troops...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so many...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they are already on standby at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,With your permission, they can move immediately to defend Kamagishi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful, wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldland has been saved from crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.41,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure preparations are made for them to rest comfortably tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Stand by here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, all troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon will soon sink behind the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At the same time, the X-Union will undoubtedly attack from the north side of the inlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.11,0:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,King Charcoal next door is defending our eastern border.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The real issue is this fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many enemies there are, we must hold this spot at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull back all forces and head for Goldland Castle! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's begun... About time! Go, don't let them spot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has begun landing on the eastern shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,50,000 Charcoal troops are supposed to be guarding the eastern shore...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one on the eastern shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the Charcoal army headed for the castle earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they drawn away...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, it's dangerous here! Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Head for Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To think there's a traitor among us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I can't just stand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor things...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Has something happened in Goldland...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz is at the northern fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the flag of Charcoalland!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Suspicious fellow! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.03,0:09:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What? They're like the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Goldland soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You might make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to your senses, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Prince Franz was the only swordsman better than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but this Charcoal soldier is surprisingly skilled...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a worthy opponent! State your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I am Silverland's Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what? Then... That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, I am so terribly sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For a moment, I was worried sick about what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deeply ashamed. I beg for your forgiveness, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also trying to get to the northern fort,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I passed out when I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, how pathetic of me. Come, lets go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're looking for Prince Franz too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the letter messenger between
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the prince and Princess Sapphire of your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're the one who always sends the pigeons?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is. Alright, off I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end, Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldland now belongs to the X-Union and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Charcoalland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only answer a traitor like you deserves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush them with sheer numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Am I too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Franz...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is Prince Franz's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Franz...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please be alive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, please come inside. The night dew is bad for your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm helpless like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't walk, and we have no horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And Goldland Castle is in that state as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:15:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,once you heal, you can retake the castle anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let us treat your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prince! Please, let Franz be safe!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please write a letter to Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will we deliver it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,These two legs of mine will be the pigeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess must be worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, take off your cloak,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,On this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,spread it out, and write on it with this ink pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, our soldiers must have escaped to Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, We must let them know that you are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I shall return by noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this one's a big catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturing them will be a major triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, leave the helpless prince for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First, let's take care of that old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We should catch up to him soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't just let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldland soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Seize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape! Whatever you do, don't let him reach Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy there, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Silverland is just ahead! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So they've finally fled into Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there! We're almost there, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Somebody open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wounded and hiding in Shinewood Cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must go there at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight, please deliver this to Lady Sapphire in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Prince Franz's cloak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a letter from the prince to Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, hey now, you shouldn't read someone else's mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Princess Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But my only regret is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to deliver Lord Franz's letter directly to Princess Sapphire myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Todd!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Todd!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:19:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sapphire. Thank you for all your letters, Old Todd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She is every bit as kind a princess as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My duty is finally fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, please look after Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Join forces and defeat those villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Old Todd. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful. I can rest easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Todd!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Todd!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dearest Sapphire,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goldland is now overrun with enemy troops. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My leg is injured and I cannot move.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may never see you alive again,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I'm truly happy to have met you in this world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am prepared to fight bravely to the end,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}as a prince of Goldland should.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I should fall, my heart will always be by your side.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I sincerely pray for your happiness. To Sapphire, from Prince Franz.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:20:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! Are you safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a new unit of enemy troops has arrived. For now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone! We're pulling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire is waiting at that farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'm returning this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the Ribbon Knight have this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Old friend, I swear we will take Goldland back with our own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.55,0:22:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Old friend, I promise I will honor your friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the very end, the old man said that Goldland and Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,should join hands and defeat the enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please look after Prince Franz. And may you both be happy forever...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Todd prayed that you would stay strong and find happiness, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire. I won't lose heart ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.83,0:22:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll make sure to move his grave back to Goldland Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:23:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to this war and restore peace to Goldland once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help me, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.36,0:23:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
